id: pm-xspd
title: "Close the jscpd/CodeFactor sensitivity gap: minTokens 115 misses low-token table clones the CodeFactor bot still files"
description: "Evidence 2026-07-11: pnpm lint:duplicates on main reports 0 clones (562 files, minLines 22 / minTokens 115) while CodeFactor filed GH-508 for a 28-line byte-identical object-literal table duplicated between create.ts:335-362 and update.ts:260-287. Short-identifier object rows stay under 115 tokens across 28 lines, so the zero-duplication gate from PR#506/pm-7wmq is structurally blind to table-shaped clones that CodeFactor's thresholds catch. Fixing pm-zuw8 clears this instance but not the class; result is recurring CodeFactor auto-issues despite a green local gate. Successor to closed parity item pm-6sqo."
type: Chore
status: closed
priority: 3
tags[3]: codefactor,duplication,quality-gate
created_at: "2026-07-11T02:58:27.882Z"
updated_at: "2026-09-08T21:58:03.136Z"
closed_at: "2026-09-08T21:58:02.430Z"
completed_at: "2026-09-08T21:58:02.430Z"
author: maintainer-agent
estimated_minutes: 60
acceptance_criteria: "jscpd config detects the GH-508-class clone shape (create.ts/update.ts normalizer tables) on a pre-fix checkout, via lowered minTokens or a second low-token/high-line profile; lint:duplicates still passes on main after pm-zuw8 lands; false-positive review documented if thresholds are lowered"
parent: pm-92if
risk: low
confidence: medium
release: 2026.8.29
resolution: "Closed the recorded long-table clone sensitivity gap with a mandatory supplementary 28-line/80-token cross-format profile and a real historical regression. Consolidated workspace-history exports under one explicit SDK owner, retaining aggregate availability."
expected_result: Mandatory local duplicate checks reject the historical GH-508 low-token table class and accept shared declarations without weakening existing profiles or adding exclusions.
actual_result: "Actual pre-fix GH-508 source files produce two clones (31 lines/96 tokens and 29 lines/82 tokens). The verbatim table fixture fails at 29 lines/101 tokens and passes after shared re-export. Current source passes all three profiles. Current 22/60 calibration and the distinct shorter GH-1002 shape are documented without claiming full CodeFactor parity; its duplicated exports are consolidated. Historical release attribution stays 2026.8.29. Sixth-round verification: all 8622 tests in 653 files pass with exact 100/100/100/100 coverage and zero uncovered statements, branches, functions and lines. All four TypeScript projects, the full quality:static gate, serialized docs/skills checks, and every linked test command pass. Both original clone profiles remain unchanged; the supplementary historical-table profile also passes. Final pushed-head CI, full platform matrix, review and preflight remain required before merge."
